# Pass "notexture": the Workshop patch "Remove Ancient Chinese Beast Gene textures" and Resolve This Instead beside this mod.
#
# XXK.AncientChineseBeastNoTexture, Workshop 3293695725, by 逍逍客, supports 1.5 and 1.6. Its Patches/Patch.xml has four
# PatchOperationRemove (success Always) on /Defs/GeneDef[defName="..."]/renderNodeProperties for SZGene_MingShe_WindWing,
# SZGene_QiongQi_FlyingStrike, SZGene_SeXie_Shoot and SZGene_YearBeast_Horn, four defNames this mod also defines. Its
# About.xml declares no dependency and no guard: the "requires the original" is only on the Steam page. So the patch
# should apply to this mod when it loads after it, and do nothing (no error) when it loads before.
# Resolve This Instead (nelim.resolvethisinstead, with Mlie.UseThisInstead 3396308787, the data it reads) is staged as a
# player of Renew would have it.
#
# ORDER. The staging activates the mods named here in this order, then the mod under test. Naming this mod's own
# packageId with a path: overlay asks for it first (see wsl-deps.ads2.map), but run 330e (2026-11-22) loaded it AFTER the patch: the order is not enforced here, and the feature no longer asserts it. A player's
# mod manager would place it.
nelim.ancientchinesebeastandgeneexpanded   path:AncientChineseBeastAndGeneExpandedRenew/Mod
XXK.AncientChineseBeastNoTexture   3293695725
Mlie.UseThisInstead   3396308787
nelim.resolvethisinstead   path:ResolveThisInstead/Mod
# The "has no value in the field" steps of 29-no-texture-patch (PiT DefFieldSteps, 2026-11-22).
nelim.pickletools.deffields   path:PickleTools/DefFieldSteps/Mod
